### 2. Header Fuzzing (e.g., for Cache Poisoning, Auth Bypass)
```
ffuf -u https://example.com/ -w /usr/share/seclists/Fuzzing/values.txt -H "X-Forwarded-For: FUZZ" -X GET
```

